sequenceDiagram
    participant Maintainer as RHOAI Release<br/>Engineer
    participant Repo as rhoai-additional-images<br/>Git Repository
    participant Manifest as rhoai-disconnected-<br/>images.yaml
    participant Mirror as Mirroring Tooling<br/>(oc mirror)
    participant Quay as quay.io/modh<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant RHIO as registry.redhat.io/rhoai<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant DisReg as Disconnected<br/>Mirror Registry

    Note over Maintainer,Repo: Image Catalog Maintenance
    Maintainer->>Repo: Update image references<br/>(digest-pinned SHA256)
    Repo->>Manifest: Commit updated YAML<br/>(47 images across 5 categories)

    Note over Mirror,DisReg: Disconnected Mirroring Flow
    Mirror->>Manifest: Read image list<br/>(file read, no network)
    Mirror->>Quay: Pull community images<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS 1.2+<br/>Registry credentials
    Quay-->>Mirror: FMS HF Tuning + Ray images<br/>(7 images)
    Mirror->>RHIO: Pull productized images<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS 1.2+<br/>Registry credentials
    RHIO-->>Mirror: Notebooks + Pipelines +<br/>Training images (40 images)
    Mirror->>DisReg: Push mirrored images<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS 1.2+<br/>Registry credentials
    DisReg-->>Mirror: Push confirmation

    Note over DisReg: Air-gapped RHOAI deployment<br/>can now pull all required images
